# Push after every job

When a task is finished, commit the relevant project files and `git push` to `origin` on the current branch. Do not wait to be asked.

- Do not commit `.env` or other secrets
- Use a short commit message that says why the change exists
- If there is nothing to commit, still push if the branch is ahead of origin
- If push fails, say so and stop
